      "id": 1,
      "text": "Cedar Bluff was incorporated in 1886 and named for the cedar‑covered bluffs that rise along the Clinch River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
